#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "IBM Quantum's open-source content {#ibm-quantums-open-source-content}"
msgstr "IBM Quantums Open-Source-Inhalte {#ibm-quantums-open-source-content}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM provides a wealth of quantum computing learning material — all open "
"source under CC BY-SA 4.0:\n"
msgstr ""
"IBM stellt eine Fülle von Lernmaterialien zum Quantencomputing bereit – alle"
" Open Source unter CC BY-SA 4.0:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[Learning](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/learning)** — Structured courses "
"from quantum basics to advanced topics\n"
msgstr ""
"**[Learning](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/learning)** — Strukturierte Kurse"
" von Quantengrundlagen bis zu fortgeschrittenen Themen\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[Tutorials](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/en/tutorials)** — 40+ "
"tutorials on transpilation, error mitigation, and more\n"
msgstr ""
"**[Tutorials](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/en/tutorials)** — Über 40 "
"Tutorials zu Transpilation, Fehlerminderung und mehr\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[Documentation](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/en/guides)** — Guides "
"and API reference for Qiskit\n"
msgstr ""
"**[Documentation](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/docs/en/guides)** — "
"Anleitungen und API-Referenz für Qiskit\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[Source repo](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation)** — All content on "
"GitHub\n"
msgstr ""
"**[Source repo](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation)** — Alle Inhalte "
"auf GitHub\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Their [Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) is always up-to-date"
" and well-designed — the best place for reading, learning, and reference.\n"
msgstr ""
"Die [Quantum Platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com) ist stets aktuell und "
"gut gestaltet – der beste Ort zum Lesen, Lernen und Nachschlagen.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "What this project adds {#what-this-project-adds}"
msgstr "Was dieses Projekt hinzufügt {#what-this-project-adds}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"IBM's [Qiskit documentation](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation) is "
"open source (CC BY-SA 4.0), but their web application is not. doQumentation "
"adds an open-source frontend with live code execution, automatic credential "
"injection, and simulator mode.\n"
msgstr ""
"IBMs [Qiskit-Dokumentation](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation) ist "
"Open Source (CC BY-SA 4.0), aber ihre Webanwendung ist es nicht. "
"doQumentation fügt ein Open-Source-Frontend mit Live-Code-Ausführung, "
"automatischer Credential-Injektion und Simulator-Modus hinzu.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Deployable anywhere — from [GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org) to "
"[Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation)"
" to [RasQberry](https://rasqberry.org/). See [all features](/features).\n"
msgstr ""
"Überall einsetzbar – von [GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org) über "
"[Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation)"
" bis zu [RasQberry](https://rasqberry.org/). Siehe [alle "
"Funktionen](/features).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "When you're ready for more {#when-youre-ready-for-more}"
msgstr "Wenn du bereit für mehr bist {#when-youre-ready-for-more}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"doQumentation helps you take your **first steps with Qiskit** — read, run "
"code, and explore — without installing anything. As you progress, head to "
"IBM's official platform:\n"
msgstr ""
"doQumentation hilft dir, deine **ersten Schritte mit Qiskit** zu machen — "
"lesen, Code ausführen und erkunden — ohne etwas installieren zu müssen. Wenn"
" du weiterkommen willst, geht es bei IBMs offizieller Plattform weiter:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Run on real hardware** — create a free [IBM Cloud "
"account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) and an Open Plan "
"instance to execute circuits on real quantum computers.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Auf echter Hardware ausführen** — erstelle ein kostenloses [IBM Cloud-"
"Konto](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) und eine Open-Plan-"
"Instanz, um Schaltkreise auf echten Quantencomputern auszuführen.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Latest content** — IBM's [Qiskit learning "
"platform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/learning) has the newest courses, "
"tutorials, and additions (some may not yet be in doQumentation).\n"
msgstr ""
"**Neueste Inhalte** — IBMs [Qiskit-"
"Lernplattform](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/learning) bietet die neuesten "
"Kurse, Tutorials und Ergänzungen (manche sind möglicherweise noch nicht in "
"doQumentation enthalten).\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Develop locally** — [install "
"Qiskit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/guides/install-qiskit) on your own "
"laptop for serious development work.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Lokal entwickeln** — [installiere "
"Qiskit](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/guides/install-qiskit) auf deinem "
"eigenen Laptop für ernsthafte Entwicklungsarbeit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"*Built on [IBM Quantum's open-source "
"documentation](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation). Thanks to the IBM "
"Quantum team for making this content freely available under CC BY-SA 4.0.*\n"
msgstr ""
"*Aufbauend auf [IBM Quantums Open-Source-"
"Dokumentation](https://github.com/Qiskit/documentation). Vielen Dank an das "
"IBM Quantum-Team dafür, dass diese Inhalte unter CC BY-SA 4.0 frei verfügbar"
" sind.*\n"

