#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Code execution {#code-execution}"
msgstr "Code-Ausführung {#code-execution}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Click **Run** on any code block. The first click starts a Jupyter kernel via"
" [Binder](https://mybinder.org) or [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine). After that, runs are instant.\n"
msgstr ""
"Klicke bei jedem Codeblock auf **Run**. Der erste Klick startet einen "
"Jupyter-Kernel über [Binder](https://mybinder.org) oder [IBM Code "
"Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-engine). Danach erfolgen Ausführungen "
"sofort.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Simulator Mode (no account needed)** — Enable [Simulator Mode](/jupyter-"
"settings#execution-mode) to run all notebooks with AerSimulator or noise-"
"model FakeBackends. Zero setup required.\n"
msgstr ""
"**Simulator-Modus (kein Konto erforderlich)** — Aktiviere den [Simulator-"
"Modus](/jupyter-settings#execution-mode), um alle Notebooks mit AerSimulator"
" oder FakeBackends mit Rauschmodell auszuführen. Null Einrichtungsaufwand "
"erforderlich.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**IBM Quantum Hardware** — Enter your API token and CRN in "
"[Settings](/jupyter-settings#ibm-quantum) once — credentials are auto-"
"injected on every run. [Create a free "
"account](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration) if you don't have "
"one.\n"
msgstr ""
"**IBM Quantum Hardware** — Gib deinen API-Token und CRN einmal in den "
"[Einstellungen](/jupyter-settings#ibm-quantum) ein — die Zugangsdaten werden"
" bei jeder Ausführung automatisch eingefügt. [Erstelle ein kostenloses "
"Konto](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/registration), falls du noch keines "
"hast.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Available execution backends</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Verfügbare Ausführungs-Backends</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Every tutorial has executable code blocks. Click **Run** to execute them "
"using one of four backends:\n"
msgstr ""
"Jedes Tutorial hat ausführbare Codeblöcke. Klicke auf **Run**, um sie mit "
"einem von vier Backends auszuführen:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Binder** (default on GitHub Pages) — Free remote Jupyter kernel via "
"[mybinder.org](https://mybinder.org)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Binder** (Standard auf GitHub Pages) — Kostenloser Remote-Jupyter-Kernel "
"über [mybinder.org](https://mybinder.org)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**IBM Code Engine** — Serverless Jupyter on your IBM Cloud account. Cold "
"start in seconds instead of minutes. [Set up](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine)\n"
msgstr ""
"**IBM Code Engine** — Serverless Jupyter auf deinem IBM Cloud-Konto. "
"Kaltstart in Sekunden statt Minuten. [Einrichten](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Local Jupyter (Docker / RasQberry)** — Connects to the local Jupyter "
"server with Qiskit pre-installed\n"
msgstr ""
"**Lokales Jupyter (Docker / RasQberry)** — Verbindet sich mit dem lokalen "
"Jupyter-Server mit vorinstalliertem Qiskit\n"

#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Custom server** — Point to any Jupyter endpoint in [Settings](/jupyter-"
"settings#advanced-settings)\n"
msgstr ""
"**Benutzerdefinierter Server** — Verweise in den [Einstellungen](/jupyter-"
"settings#advanced-settings) auf einen beliebigen Jupyter-Endpunkt\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"When multiple backends are available, choose which one to use from "
"[Settings](/jupyter-settings#backend-selection).\n"
msgstr ""
"Wenn mehrere Backends verfügbar sind, wähle in den [Einstellungen](/jupyter-"
"settings#backend-selection), welches verwendet werden soll.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</details>\n"
msgstr "</details>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Deployment options</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Bereitstellungsoptionen</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "doQumentation is available as:\n"
msgstr "doQumentation ist verfügbar als:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org)** — Static site with "
"[Binder](https://mybinder.org) or [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-settings#code-"
"engine) for remote code execution\n"
msgstr ""
"**[GitHub Pages](https://doqumentation.org)** — Statische Website mit "
"[Binder](https://mybinder.org) oder [IBM Code Engine](/jupyter-"
"settings#code-engine) für Remote-Code-Ausführung\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation)**"
" — Full stack locally, offline capable\n"
msgstr ""
"**[Docker](https://github.com/JanLahmann/doQumentation/pkgs/container/doqumentation)**"
" — Vollständiger Stack lokal, offline-fähig\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**[RasQberry](https://rasqberry.org/)** — Self-hosted on Raspberry Pi with "
"local Jupyter kernel\n"
msgstr ""
"**[RasQberry](https://rasqberry.org/)** — Selbst gehostet auf Raspberry Pi "
"mit lokalem Jupyter-Kernel\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Run locally with Podman / Docker</summary>\n"
msgstr ""
"<details>\n"
"<summary>Lokal ausführen mit Podman / Docker</summary>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install [Podman Desktop](https://podman-desktop.io/) or [Docker "
"Desktop](https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop/) (Mac / Windows / "
"Linux), then run:\n"
msgstr ""
"Installiere [Podman Desktop](https://podman-desktop.io/) oder [Docker "
"Desktop](https://www.docker.com/products/docker-desktop/) (Mac / Windows / "
"Linux), dann führe aus:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Open [http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080) — code execution works "
"locally, no Binder wait time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Öffne [http://localhost:8080](http://localhost:8080) — Code-Ausführung "
"funktioniert lokal, keine Binder-Wartezeit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "For a lightweight version without local code execution (~60 MB):\n"
msgstr ""
"Für eine leichtgewichtige Version ohne lokale Code-Ausführung (~60 MB):\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Using Docker instead? Just replace `podman` with `docker` — the commands are"
" identical. Images are multi-arch (`linux/amd64` + `linux/arm64`), so Apple "
"Silicon Macs work natively.\n"
msgstr ""
"Du verwendest Docker? Ersetze einfach `podman` durch `docker` — die Befehle "
"sind identisch. Die Images sind Multi-Arch (`linux/amd64` + `linux/arm64`), "
"sodass Apple Silicon Macs nativ funktionieren.\n"
